{
    "title": "Skechers",
    "description": "The Skechers app is the one-stop shop for everything Skechers. Whether you are shopping the latest releases, searching for your preferred colors and sizes while in-store, or earning and redeeming Skechers Plus rewards our app provides easy access to the features you use most. \r\n\r\nFEATURES INCLUDE:\r\n\r\n*Skechers Plus\u2122 loyalty dashboard with access to points earning activities, information on benefits, tier status, and rewards, as well as your member ID for in-store sign in.\r\n*Instant Search to quickly locate your perfect style, color and size!\r\n*Barcode Search to help you find your size and additional colors when in store.\r\n*Receive special offers from Skechers in your app Inbox\r\n*Create wishlists of your favorite items\r\n*Store Locator helps you find your neighborhood Skechers retail store.\r\n*Curbside and in-store pick-up: See if the shoes you want are available before visiting your Skechers store. Buy on the app and pick up in store or curbside.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Skechers app is the one-stop shop for everything Skechers. Whether you are shopping the latest releases, searching for your preferred colors and sizes while in-store, or earning and redeeming Skechers Plus rewards our app provides easy access to the features you use most. <br><br>FEATURES INCLUDE:<br><br>*Skechers Plus\u2122 loyalty dashboard with access to points earning activities, information on benefits, tier status, and rewards, as well as your member ID for in-store sign in.<br>*Instant Search to quickly locate your perfect style, color and size!<br>*Barcode Search to help you find your size and additional colors when in store.<br>*Receive special offers from Skechers in your app Inbox<br>*Create wishlists of your favorite items<br>*Store Locator helps you find your neighborhood Skechers retail store.<br>*Curbside and in-store pick-up: See if the shoes you want are available before visiting your Skechers store. Buy on the app and pick up in store or curbside.",
